sequenceDiagram
    participant Author as Schema Author
    participant DG as DataGerry
    participant Bridge as DataGerry Bridge
    participant Bedrock as Bedrock Lakehouse
    participant Airbyte
    participant Source as Source System
    participant Forge as Forge, Spark and dbt
    participant Atlas
    participant OPA
    participant Overlook as Overlook, Trino
    participant Compass
    participant Analyst as Security Analyst

    Note over Author,Bedrock: Phase 1: Schema definition
    Author->>DG: define ObjectType Product, field Sensitive=bool
    DG-->>Bridge: Type created or updated
    Bridge->>Bedrock: CREATE or ALTER TABLE ext_product
    Bridge->>Atlas: refresh SchemaRegistry cache
    Atlas-->>Bridge: ack

    Note over Airbyte,Bedrock: Phase 2: Ingestion, independent of Atlas
    Airbyte->>Source: extract product and view-log records
    Source-->>Airbyte: raw rows
    Airbyte->>Bedrock: land raw records in Bronze

    Note over Forge,Bedrock: Phase 3: Transform, conform, score, independent of Atlas
    Forge->>Bedrock: read current Product schema, cached from Bridge sync
    Forge->>Bedrock: write conformed Silver ext_product rows, dbt model
    Forge->>Bedrock: dbt snapshot plus confidence scoring writes Gold graph_nodes and graph_edges

    Note over Analyst,Compass: Phase 4: Investigation
    Analyst->>Compass: open Graph Explorer
    Analyst->>Compass: run Sensitive Product View Audit use case
    Compass->>Atlas: GET use-cases/sensitive-product-view-audit/steps

    Atlas->>OPA: can this user run this use case
    OPA-->>Atlas: allow
    Atlas->>Atlas: write audit log entry

    Atlas->>Overlook: run seeded SQL, Views edges vs group membership
    Overlook->>Bedrock: read Gold graph_nodes and graph_edges
    Bedrock-->>Overlook: rows
    Overlook-->>Atlas: anomalous view found, no group membership backing it

    Atlas-->>Compass: highlighted path plus narrative steps
    Compass-->>Analyst: renders traversal highlight, sensitive exposure visible
